**Appendix B** holds, unchanged: the edge cases and the Kirousis–Papadimitriou gap (old §3.3), the thirteenth member (old §3.4), why the published proof fails, the search for smaller counterexamples, and Proposition 4.8 and Theorem 4.9, now B.1 and B.2.

